    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131180/extras/ccc058833079ff0782a0ad5c1e1753fe.avif?t=1729341398\" /></div><br><br>Many years ago, demons, monsters, goblins and dragons had invaded the world.<br><br>Many creatures, from where and how they came, were killing the people and reigning in the lands they occupied.<br>Until a very talented wizard shows up.<br><br>This sorcerer sealed the main demon Azazil and all creatures with a spell called the death spell and imprisoned him in a pandora's box in a room of a vast mountain.<br><br>And the price was the death of the mage.<br>And the world was at peace again.<br><br>Centuries have passed and no one, except for very rare people, was even aware of the existence of these creatures.<br>Until a treasure hunter discovers the hidden cave and opens Pandora's box..<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131180/extras/3fc041ae721acc23e3defe0313745b3c.avif?t=1729341398\" /></div><br><br>Ares is a warrior medieval people, his wife died many years ago, lives with a son and has no magic abilities.<br>He carries the holy spirit of the sorcerer whose son died many years ago,and no one knows about it.<br><br>Ares is injured when demons attack their village during a walk with his son, and his son is kidnapped by a demon.<br>Azazil is aware of this soul and learns from the diamond ball that this soul is in a child, but he does not know who it is.<br><br>If the child dies, Azazil dies at the same time. The magic of the wizard who imprisoned him in Pandora's box circulates in his blood.<br>The devils are gathering all the children in the villages. Azazil wants to detect the child with his own magic and neutralize this spell.<br><br>Then, a creature that takes Ares' son to the temple is shot by an archer and the child falls into the middle of a mountain, lonely and helpless.<br><br>Ares seeks the help of a most talented and knowledgeable wizard to find his son and avenge all that has happened.<br>and he goes on this way, his magic ability develops over time<br><br>Will Ares find his son?<br><br>Will he save the world?<br><br>What will happen to other peoples?<br><br>Is he alone?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131180/extras/107f4651d73aa9b98f43105376674efd.avif?t=1729341398\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different melee weapon such as Ax, Sword, Teber, Bardiche, Bilhook, Dagger, Shield, Heavy Sword, Mace, Messer, Partisan, Angled Ax, Sax, Spear, Voulge, Warhammer and Zweihander<br></li><li>Many magic abilities like Ice and Death Rain Strike<br></li><li>Beautiful and realistic world with best graphics and many skins<br></li><li>Collection Items (gold, scroll, memories, diaries, etc.)</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131180/extras/9986bc2868090383757abba6eda9a274.poster.avif?t=1729341398\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131180/extras/9986bc2868090383757abba6eda9a274.webm?t=1729341398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131180/extras/9986bc2868090383757abba6eda9a274.mp4?t=1729341398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
