ountain, lonely and helpless.<br><br>Ares seeks the help of a most talented and knowledgeable wizard to find his son and avenge all that has happened.<br>and he goes on this way, his magic ability develops over time<br><br>Will Ares find his son?<br><br>Will he save the world?<br><br>What will happen to other peoples?<br><br>Is he alone?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131180/extras/107f4651d73aa9b98f43105376674efd.avif?t=1729341398\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different melee weapon such as Ax, Sword, Teber, Bardiche, Bilhook, Dagger, Shield, Heavy Sword, Mace, Messer, Partisan, Angled Ax, Sax, Spear, Voulge, Warhammer and Zweihander<br></li><li>Many magic abilities like Ice and Death Rain Strike<br></li><li>Beautiful and realistic world with best graphics and many skins<br></li><li>Collection Items (gold, scroll, memories, diaries, etc.)</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131180/extras/9986bc2868090383757abba6eda9a274.poster.avif?t=1729341398\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131180/extras/9986bc2868090383757abba6eda9a274.webm?t=1729341398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131180/extras/9986bc2868090383757abba6eda9a274.mp4?t=1729341398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
